    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30074" root="عكز" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَكْوَزٌ</span></b> , (K,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَكُوزٌ</span></b> , like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَبُورٌ</span> as written by
Sgh, (TA,) or ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُكُوزٌ</span></b> , (thus accord. to the O,) [or
more probably, I think, ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَكُّوزٌ</span></b> ,] <i>A thing like the</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُبَّة</span> [or <i>socket of a spear-head</i>], <i>of iron, into
which the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْذَم</span> [app. meaning the <i>person afflicted
with elephantiasis</i>] <i>puts his leg,</i> or <i>foot.</i> (Ibn-
'Abbád, O, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عُكَّازَةٌ</span>.

